  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_009 (scvi_n200 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.6776). This experiment tests whether changing the aggregation method from avgpool to transformer (while keeping RNA encoder, image encoder, and fusion method fixed) improves performance. This isolates the effect of aggregation, a critical design choice, and builds on the strong foundation of config_009. It balances exploitation of a high-performing baseline with exploration of a key hyperparameter."
